{
  "Npcs.Lumberjack.Desc": "At over 2 meters tall, this bulkily built brownish-red incubus is a mountain of a man. His short brown hair is parted by long and wicked horns, and he has similarly dark-brown eyes. Adding even more to his masculine appearance, he has a modest beard. Extending out from his rugged clothes are a pair of vast demon-wings and, further down, a long, arrow-tipped tail. In his hands is a fierce-looking felling axe, designed to chop down trees. You doubt he'll have any trouble chopping down people with it."
  "Npcs.Lumberjack.Name": "Lumberjack"
}
